      "question": "What will be the next letters in the following sequence? FEXW : GHVU :: JITS : _____.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>What will be the next letters in the following sequence?</p>\n\n<p>FEXW :&nbsp;GHVU ::&nbsp;JITS :&nbsp;_____.</p>\n",
