      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Given,</p>\n\n<p>FEXW :&nbsp;GHVU ::&nbsp;JITS :&nbsp;_____.</p>\n\n<p>We Know,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage898.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F1_Prashant_Madhu_30.12.20_D1.png\" style=\"width: 153px; height: 75px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F1_Prashant_Madhu_30.12.20_D2.png\" style=\"width: 153px; height: 75px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Hence, the correct answer is KLRQ.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage898.png",
